{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "84a73c13f966c53b8bf6411968a3f987558a9cb0e62619323cef0d0bdcfc0575", "ja": "雨宿りはここで", "zh": "在此避雨", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0baa0dd16597546d38d96f66f9f4a8c65e6c0b011063f0abd56bc0ceab59648f", "ja": "美希のテレビ出演が好評で、デュオ公演にも\n取材が殺到。プロデューサーが喜ぶならと\n美希は快く応じその様子をなぜかエレナ達\nは覗き見。なんでもない顔をしている美希\nだが、プロデューサーは変化に気付く。", "zh": "美希上电视的反响很好，连双人公演也引来了大量采访。美希想着只要制作人高兴，便欣然接受了采访，不知为何，艾蕾娜她们还在一旁偷看。美希表面上若无其事，但制作人察觉到了她的变化。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ff6fb555d54990f639d22dc631ab76b24081bb3d1c8ee24177f1e9f9137aff1f", "ja": "（美希が出演したテレビ番組が好評だったおかげで、\nデュオ公演の取材が増えた。うれしい悲鳴だ！）", "zh": "（多亏了美希参加的电视节目广受好评，双人公演的采访也增加了。真是痛并快乐着啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1001_003mik", "source_sha256": "1466465b10da3ba461ac8d7cc40273e12d1433f349753140b095baaa4f0e43af", "ja": "今日はこのあと、雑誌の取材でしょ。\n明日は撮影を3件……で、あってる？", "zh": "今天接下来是杂志采访，对吧？\n明天要进行3项拍摄……没错吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3ecb7ee0b62d451a239218d4d44445a6de206ffa1ccdc315240a473989b68f79", "ja": "そうだな。公演のレッスン中だし、なるべく\n無理のないよう組んだつもりだけど……いけそうか？", "zh": "是啊。现在正在进行公演的训练，我本来就尽量安排得不过分勉强……你能应付得来吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "8f024d1c0174de760e8bfecd2a976e8cd163c7e1074c19f586f420cbfef96baf", "ja": "平気だよ。それに、ミキががんばったら、\nハニーがよろこんでくれるんでしょ？", "zh": "没事的啦。而且美希努力的话，\n亲爱的就会很高兴吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1004_p", "source_sha256": "71682b6eb5c3abd35a811271c41ab60aff41a8eed28b09889bb6568cb3ef5993", "ja": "もちろん。ただ、無理はしないでほしいけどな。\nあと、人前でその呼び方は控えてほしい……。", "zh": "当然。不过，我不希望你太勉强自己。\n还有，在别人面前还是别那么叫我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1005_003mik", "source_sha256": "91c8601ac8371ff0caab9061cfd510643c50bd7c6b53d64b9597af1647fc1e83", "ja": "そんなの、誰も気にしないと思うけどな。", "zh": "我觉得那种事，根本没人会在意吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1006_p", "source_sha256": "80d7b92375f6e86ec38e89af68eb54c8f414b9d77a5fc12106a5f5b77a3735ba", "ja": "ダメダメ。\n誰が通りかかるかわからないんだから。", "zh": "不行不行。\n毕竟不知道谁会路过。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1007_003mik", "source_sha256": "9e7aea1240e6a4f6ef8b3feab570e7bb3007f7dd13de7531a1a0d0e0a1af695a", "ja": "わかったの……。ねえ{$P$}、\nお仕事が終わったら、スイーツ食べに行きたいな。", "zh": "知道了啦……呐，{$P$}，\n等工作结束了，美希想去吃甜点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1008_003mik", "source_sha256": "77d2be29e4950d57438ba0a59aea4fd968d28b619cb986aceb5dce2cc720ab20", "ja": "ミキ、行ってみたいお店があるの。\nちょっとくらいなら、いいよね？", "zh": "美希有一家想去试试的店。\n去一下应该没关系吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "92e4d701f66a776ac450ac554a03c16bd1e6b53ee2c973b5f73960aa63e6c121", "ja": "時間があれば構わないけど……\n今日は、やけに甘えてくるんだな？", "zh": "如果有时间的话倒无所谓……\n不过，你今天怎么特别撒娇啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1010_003mik", "source_sha256": "3e98d786d84b1a9d9bbf23623a7eac036ed2d08c34033482eac38d57d71a4798", "ja": "だって{$P$}、出張ばっかりで\nミキのことほったらかしなんだもん。", "zh": "因为{$P$}总是出差，把美希丢在一边不管嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1011_p", "source_sha256": "27a1a93dda64ba52344594a98ffb8c47be4a1a9d179fc10bb0898f51f80e470e", "ja": "いや、そこを突かれると……。\n申し訳ないとは思ってるよ。", "zh": "被你这么一戳中痛处，我还真……\n我也觉得很过意不去啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1012_003mik", "source_sha256": "2b59d592a395b5ab65b42dfc5b7bd18314ce2e670d9c5aa641a704abe1a12977", "ja": "それに、みんなもなんだか……。", "zh": "而且，大家好像也……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1013_p", "source_sha256": "698bceb8b2cde22b3e18c7997b79111a01188443db7d58daa8772fe9dfeca06c", "ja": "え？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1014_003mik", "source_sha256": "82eb077ee0262ba159c7cd0d98ed8906a4d17dee2eecbf3f4794f57a514c16ad", "ja": "あっ、ううん。なんでもないの。", "zh": "啊，没什么。就当我没说。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1015_003mik", "source_sha256": "da21578b821afc2831962017726f26cf95a53d7335cae3ca51e2b7f719c77051", "ja": "公演のレッスンも、お仕事もちゃんとしてるの。\nミキ、すっごくえらいよね？", "zh": "公演的练习也好，工作也好，我都有好好完成哦。\n美希是不是特别厉害？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "e700f722552b010571e7b424287318e010a608d1d377b2296ea40ee307859630", "ja": "ああ。美希はよくやってくれていると思うよ。", "zh": "嗯。我觉得美希一直都做得很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1017_003mik", "source_sha256": "e038671ebe8ab7effdcad59ab05757fe3560ccbaaee29ec045660e1228f9460b", "ja": "でしょ？　だからちょっとくらい、\n甘えたっていいと思うな。ね、ハニー♪", "zh": "对吧？所以稍微撒个娇也没关系吧。对不对，亲爱的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1018_p", "source_sha256": "9b93c6be8786505453648635ca19f85dc560cf11f362b90907f6eff3b1f34096", "ja": "わ、わかった。それは考えておくから。\nだから、美希も呼び方は戻してくれ。", "zh": "我、我知道了。我会考虑一下的。\n所以，美希也把称呼改回来吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "debca55441208a10c38008df5886ca55fb3595c05a5f1235c29a4dc54e976ae9", "ja": "出張もやっと落ち着いたし、\n今後は公演に集中できると思うから……ん？", "zh": "出差总算告一段落了，接下来应该能专心准备公演了……嗯？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1020_050jul", "source_sha256": "9399bc117ee36386774d4d662d9bee9c5f3c800bbb7239b0d6f1ad9894d8aeab", "ja": "！\nまずい、隠れろ！", "zh": "！\n糟了，快躲起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1021_050jul", "source_sha256": "4fe1be06ed427f7cf80b1714415ca62ad7e94fc5ffd31cc7d0ae0c319fb3aeef", "ja": "ふう、危ない。\nなんとか見つからずに済んだな……。", "zh": "呼，真危险。\n总算没被发现……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1022_033sih", "source_sha256": "658babedbb2c7a6070237b6c7339146467a5f7aaac3f651c65fbbb73076873cc", "ja": "どう、でしょうか？\nバレバレだった気もしますけど……。", "zh": "怎么样，呢？\n感觉好像完全暴露了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1023_018ele", "source_sha256": "1ea59e45048994eeef440a9dca96856e0aed785c9b610dbfb9fad6e0f56cec36", "ja": "ミキ、すごく楽しそうにお話してた……。\nやっぱり{$P$}は手強いヨ～！", "zh": "美希聊得特别开心呢……\n果然，{$P$}很难对付啊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1024_050jul", "source_sha256": "8a3155038eb79d5a792ceb57100e66bb605ec483ff40fb1507782d4eceee66b9", "ja": "何言ってんだ、デュオの相方だろ！\n気持ちで負けてどうすんだ！", "zh": "说什么呢，你可是二重唱的搭档吧！\n怎么能在气势上输掉呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "4cea7901043a5c2aa3b1c7026781041c90a5f1cfe7ede53256f70aca40e019e5", "ja": "{$P$}さんは、私たちアイドルとは\n違いますから。比べなくていいと思いますけど。", "zh": "{$P$}先生和我们偶像\n是不一样的。我觉得没必要去比较。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1026_p", "source_sha256": "371c1effb96b34190d78f59aa38c3dafbb15d93b45c40dcf00a6b1e50aa73efb", "ja": "みんな、あんなところで\n何やってるんだ……？", "zh": "大家在那种地方\n干什么呢……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1027_003mik", "source_sha256": "15011a54946b003e25a10a05e3dc3f7a6f77b5e9803123c0d50e0a76f8ca5740", "ja": "みんなこの前から、ずっとあんなカンジ。\nミキには、よくわからないの。", "zh": "大家前阵子开始就一直是那个样子。\n美希也搞不太懂呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1028_p", "source_sha256": "774d79fae324439ec2570717f9cdcdf8c5479b93d0a4af57a1992b52479592c4", "ja": "え？　そうなのか？", "zh": "咦？是这样吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "4aea82680db2fd3d403e3e014a56ae1a266dbc599e31470f5f8d7fb18779f01e", "ja": "うん。……それより{$P$}、\nお仕事の打ち合わせしちゃお。", "zh": "嗯。……比起那个，{$P$}，\n我们先商量一下工作吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1030_p", "source_sha256": "a79de858b718776d05554d7977ba500e59ca9979c0e75fbfab91fe73c4c8dc31", "ja": "あ、ああ。\nそうだな……。", "zh": "啊，嗯。\n是啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0208_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_05_1031_p", "source_sha256": "1c002c0d0d3da0d393e7dcba051131d02f86da0a157f36213471b3146434a268", "ja": "（美希……何でもない顔をして見えるけど。\nもしかして……）", "zh": "（美希……看起来一脸若无其事的样子。\n难道说……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
